譯制度化<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></span></h3><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/11/927.html\" target=\"_blank\">李江却台語文教基金會針對9/27立法院通譯事件聲明</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">2</span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/929.html\" target=\"_blank\">9/29記者會簡要記錄<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span></a></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">發起單位：李江却台語文教基金會<br />記錄：張翠硯</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">4</span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">傅元罄<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/11/hoo-iau-leh-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">留hōo iáu活--leh ê人</a><br />8<br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;